Boolean information retrieval being asked to query a Boolean expression
    - and, or, not and join query terms
        -- each document is a set of words
        -- each doc matches or not boolean expression
    - the simplest model to build (starting point)
Commercial retrieval tool for 3 decades, before ranking
retrieval model.
